|description2 = {{sbc|Innate:}} Whenever '''Ambessa''' casts an ability, she generates a {{tip|stack}} of ''Medarda Maxim'' after the ability's respective lockout for 4 seconds, refreshing with subsequent casts and stacking up to 3 times. Basic attacks consume one stack each to become empowered.
|description3 = {{sbc|Medarda Maxim:}} '''Ambessa's''' next {{tip|basic attack}} {{tip|on-attack}} is empowered to have an {{tip|uncancellable windup}}, gain {{sti|75 '''bonus''' range}} and {{sti|{{as|50% '''bonus''' attack speed}}}}, deal {{as|{{pplevel|5 to 25}}|physical damage}} {{as|(+ 20% '''bonus''' AD)}} {{as|'''bonus''' physical damage}}, which applies {{as|{{sti|life steal}}}}, and restore {{sti|energy|{{as|{{pp|40 to 70|1;7;13}} energy}}}}.
